
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd"><html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="en" lang="en"><head id="ctl00_head"><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="DC.Creator" content="CDC" /><meta name="DC.Language" content="en-US" /><meta name="dc.type" scheme="DCTERMS.DCMIType" content="Text" /><meta name="verify-v1" content="QgNWnEgcBTh4dpn9Y0xbZ2ZCWwGOHR6DJLa61KkMaGs=" /><meta name="msvalidate.01" content="149B31BC38DC9B7425C5DC64BB53E4F1" /><meta name="y_key" content="d509505b79c1962b" /><link rel="schema.dc" href="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" /><link rel="schema.dcterms" href="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" /><style type="text/css" media="screen, projection">@import url("http://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/css/A/base.css");</style><style type="text/css" media="print">@import url("http://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/css/A/print.css");</style><script type="text/javascript" src="http://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/js/A/common.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="http://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/js/A/startup.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="http://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/js/A/textSizer.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="http://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/js/A/blocks-ie.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="http://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/js/A/video.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="http://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/js/A/navScripts.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="http://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/js/A/share.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="http://www.cdc.gov/news/scripts/govdelivery.js"></script><!-- compliance patch for microsoft browsers --><!--[if IE 6]><script type="text/javascript" src="http://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/js/A/blocks-ie6.js"></script><link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="http://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/css/A/threeColumn-ie.css" /><![endif]--><link rel="shortcut icon" href="http://www.cdc.gov/images/home/favicon.ico" /><link rel="home" href="http://www.cdc.gov/" title="Home" /><link rel="P3Pv1" href="http://www.cdc.gov/w3c/p3p.xml" /><!-- Begin Survey scripts --><script type="text/javascript" src="http://www.cdc.gov/JScript/triggerParams.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="http://www.cdc.gov/JScript/stdLauncher.js"></script><script type="text/javascript">Poll();</script><!-- End Survey scripts --><style id="ctl00_ucCss_styleSheet" type="text/css" media="screen, projection">@import url("css7.ashx");</style><script type="text/javascript" src="/travel/includes/js/jquery-1.2.6.min.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="/travel/includes/js/forward.js"></script><meta name="dc.keywords" content="travel health, travel advise, travel safety, travel news, safe food and water, vaccinations" /><meta name="keywords" content="travel health, travel advise, travel safety, travel news, safe food and water, vaccinations" /><meta name="description" content="Official U.S. government health recommendations for traveling. Provided by the U.S. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC)." /><meta name="dc.description" content="Official U.S. government health recommendations for traveling. Provided by the U.S. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC)." lang="en" /><meta name="dc.subject" content="Chapter 4 - Rickettsial Infections - Yellow Book" /><meta name="dc.title" content="Chapter 4 - Rickettsial Infections - Yellow Book" /><style type="text/css" media="all">@import url('/travel/css8.ashx');</style><meta name="dc.date.reviewed" content="2007-06-20" /><meta name="dc.date.created" content="2007-06-20" /><title>Chapter 4 - Rickettsial Infections - Yellow Book | CDC Travelers' Health</title></head><body class="secondTier"><a name="top"></a><div id="skipmenu"><a href="#search" class="skippy" title="Skip to search">Skip directly to search</a><a href