ation">Giardiasis and Amebiasis Medication</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentCounterfeitDrugs.aspx" title="Counterfeit Drugs">Counterfeit Drugs</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentIllnessInjuryAbroad.aspx" title="Illness &amp; Injury Abroad">Illness &amp; Injury Abroad</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentReferencesResources.aspx" title="References &amp; Resources">References &amp; Resources</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentReferences.aspx" title="References">References</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentResources.aspx" title="Resources">Resources</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentPresentationsHealthPros.aspx" title="Presentations for Health Professionals">Presentations for Health Professionals</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentPodcasts.aspx" title="Travel Podcasts">Travel Podcasts</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentRSS.aspx" title="RSS Feeds">RSS Feeds</a></li></ul></div><div class="bottom"></div></div><div id="breadBox"><ul id="breadcrumbs"><li style="display:none; background-image: none;"></li></ul></div><script language="javascript" type="text/javascript"><!--
